// Update 2.5 "Cosmetic": the three shops and Watto's casino.
// The market splits into three tabs: Vekko the Fence (cards), Luthen's Gallery
// (cosmetics, the only shop that shows Beskar) and The Hutt's Casino, run by
// Watto, which holds Sabacc, the Shell Game, Lucky Charms, the Legendary
// Exchange and three new games: Holo-Chess Wager, Podrace Bets and Pazaak.
// Each new game allows 10 plays a day. Odds pay bet x (odds + 1) and the
// chance of each pick is proportional to 1/(odds+1), so the house keeps a
// small edge. All animation stops when the casino is off screen or hidden.
